    "training_evaluation": "Implement a two-phase training schedule: Phase 1 (epochs 1-3) freezes BERT and trains only the custom heads and new fusion module with lr=2e-4; Phase 2 unfreezes BERT with lr=2e-5 and applies gradient clipping max_norm=0.5 and gradient normalization (scale gradients so that BERT and custom contributions have equal norm). Use early stopping patience increased to 7 to accommodate more careful training. Implementation: add a 'freeze_bert' flag, switch after 3 epochs; in optimizer step, use torch.nn.utils.clip_grad_norm_ and a custom gradient_normalize function. Interface: same training loop structure, same dataloaders."
  }
}"}

