n: comment out the StylometricCNN usage in MultiViewAuthorClassifier forward, replace its contribution with a zero tensor of appropriate size; set requires_grad=False for all BERT parameters. Interface: forward method signature unchanged; char_ids parameter becomes optional but is expected to be passed (can be ignored)."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
